    "message": "Devices never re-register after the introducer link drops (coordinator restart / IP change), and TCP punch can fail when both sides connect at once. Upgrade to 0.9.13.",
    "reasons": [
      "CriticalBugs"
    ]
  },
  "description": "P2P, end-to-end-encrypted remote-connection SDK. Connect two endpoints anywhere — behind NAT, over a J-PAKE-authenticated AES-256-GCM channel — in one call. Direct (TCP/UDP), introducer hole-punch, TURN-style relay, and WSS-gateway transports behind one tiny facade.",
  "id": "RemoteViewer.ConnectKit",
